# Records the durable run-card entry (scripts/demo-ui.ts card) — fictional data only.
Output docs/images/flow-run-card.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1050
Set Height 640
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 20
Hide
Type "node --import tsx scripts/demo-ui.ts card"
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /collapsed run-card/
Show
Sleep 9s
